126 246V226Q126 130 145 91Q177 30 250 30Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E1-MJMAIN-2E\" d=\"M78 60Q78 84 95 102T138 120Q162 120 180 104T199 61Q199 36 182 18T139 0T96 17T78 60Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-74\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-61\" x=\"389\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-6E\" x=\"890\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMATHI-3B8\" x=\"1613\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-3D\" x=\"2360\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(3416,0)\">\n<g transform=\"translate(120,0)\">\n<rect stroke=\"none\" width=\"2095\" height=\"60\" x=\"0\" y=\"220\"></rect>\n<g transform=\"translate(115,676)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-73\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-69\" x=\"394\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-6E\" x=\"673\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMATHI-3B8\" x=\"1396\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n<g transform=\"translate(60,-726)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-63\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-6F\" x=\"444\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-73\" x=\"945\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMATHI-3B8\" x=\"1506\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-2E\" x=\"5752\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span></p>\n<p>To see why this is true, let's take a look at the following triangle.</p>\n<div id=\"graphic-18194228cf1fb1c637db5880929e639f\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/18194228cf1fb1c637db5880929e639f\"></div>\n\n<p>For this particular triangle, we have</p>\n<p><span class=\"mjpage mjpage__block\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"41.383ex\" height=\"4.843ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -1.838ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -1293.7 17817.5 2085\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-2-Title\">\n<title id